<p>Hi,</p>

<p>Thank you for your email. Please note that professional indemnity insurance is operated on a ‘claims made’ basis, meaning if there is not an active policy in force when a claim is notified (even if the work it relates to, was carried out when a policy was active) there will be no cover in force. Please bear this in mind before cancelling, if you still want to cancel, please confirm this on email or call us on 020 3808 7099, We are open Monday – Friday from 9:00am – 18:00pm.</p>
